---
source: src/cli/app.rs
expression: "command_help_for_test(\"doctor\")"
---
Show skills installation, paths, and optional tooling status

Usage: doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --install-missing
          Install missing tokei and Universal Ctags with global mise config

      --check
          Validate the oy skills installation; exit nonzero on failure

  -h, --help
          Print help
